From 26718b8138c7d5c3cac415bafc6e3cce156482bc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex Perrin <44126061+AlexPerrin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 15:11:29 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Grand Exchange: tax-exempt items

Sales of the items OSRS exempts from the 2% tax (bonds, low-level ammo and food,
teleport tablets, basic tools, ...) pay no tax; enum ge_tax_exempt.

Licence note: ge_tax_exempt.toml comes from the Old School RuneScape Wiki's "Grand
Exchange" page, section "Exempt from tax"
(https://oldschool.runescape.wiki/w/Grand_Exchange#Exempt_from_tax, 17 October 2026),
by the wiki's contributors, licensed CC BY-NC-SA 3.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/3.0/). That file stays under CC BY-NC-SA,
which differs from OpenRune's licence.
